---
title: "pause/unpause (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: caller check
    q_check_auth --> q_check_state: caller is legionOperator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_state --> q_pause: action == pause AND paused == false
    q_check_state --> q_unpause: action == unpause AND paused == true
    q_check_state --> q_revert_state: invalid state transition
    q_revert_state --> [*]: revert InvalidStateTransition
    q_pause --> [*]: paused = true, emit Paused
    q_unpause --> [*]: paused = false, emit Unpaused

    note right of q_pause
        INV-001: pause preserves investor fund access (withdrawals still work)
        INV-002: pause disables invest, claim, and admin operations
    end note
